d185469e6df52f502f906fb50a:tests/scripts/graph/_helpers.py#tests/scripts/graph/_helpers.py::_write_archive_event-docstring\tWrite the ARCHIVED event that marks ticket_id archived in reduced state.\tPASS\t28\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\r\ntests/scripts/graph/conftest.py::<module>-docstring\t0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e:tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py#tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py::<module>-docstring\tfa5a6e333dec79d185469e6df52f502f906fb50a:tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py#tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py::<module>-docstring\tGraph fixtures, with parent test-path and network guards from higher conftests.\tPASS\t43\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\r\ntests/scripts/graph/conftest.py::_isolate_git_from_enclosing_repo-docstring\t0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e:tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py#tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py::_isolate_git_from_enclosing_repo-docstring\tfa5a6e333dec79d185469e6df52f502f906fb50a:tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py#tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py::_isolate_git_from_enclosing_repo-docstring\tKeep plain-directory tracker Git calls below the test's tmp root. LINK event files remain available to graph tests. Git cannot walk upward and commit them into the checkout. Push tests create their own repo below the ceiling.\tPASS\t153\t37\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\r\ntests/scripts/graph/conftest.py::_link_writes_persist_without_repo-docstring\t0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e:tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py#tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py::_link_writes_persist_without_repo-docstring\tfa5a6e333dec79d185469e6df52f502f906fb50a:tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py#tests/scripts/graph/conftest.py::_link_writes_persist_without_repo-docstring\tPersist composed LINK files directly for graph-only directory fixtures. A directory without Git cannot use the production committer. Git-backed push tests still use the production committer. Store durability is tested separately.\tPASS\t121\t31\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\r\ntests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py::<module>-docstring\t0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e:tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py#tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py::<module>-docstring\tfa5a6e333dec79d185469e6df52f502f906fb50a:tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py#tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py::<module>-docstring\tCheck lock health without changing locks. An active holder is informational. A dead holder is a finding. Staleness decisions come from lock_owner, not a second test-side rule.\tPASS\t150\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\r\ntests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py::_isolated_snapshot_store-docstring\t0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e:tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py#tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py::_isolated_snapshot_store-docstring\tfa5a6e333dec79d185469e6df52f502f906fb50a:tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py#tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py::_isolated_snapshot_store-docstring\tKeep the host-global snapshot-store probe under this test's tmp dir.\tPASS\t56\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\r\ntests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py::<module>-docstring\t0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e:tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py#tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py::<module>-docstring\tfa5a6e333dec79d185469e6df52f502f906fb50a:tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py#tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py::<module>-docstring\tCheck doctor classification, repair ordering, and failure containment. A failed repair must retain its dependency. Ambiguous relation unlinking is refused.\tPASS\t66\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\r\ntests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py::test_repair_force_writes_the_pre_repair_tag_and_repoints_it-docstring\t0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e:tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py#tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py::test_repair_force_writes_the_pre_repair_tag_and_repoints_it-docstring\tfa5a6e333dec79d185469e6df52f502f906fb50a:tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py#tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py::test_repair_force_writes_the_pre_repair_tag_and_repoints_it-docstring\tTag the pre-repair HEAD as the rollback anchor on every repair run. Use a Git-backed tracker so the tag and HEAD assertions cannot pass on empty values. A repeated run repoints the tag to its own starting commit.\tPASS\t91\t38\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\r\ntests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py::test_run_repair_does_not_hold_a_lock_that_blocks_its_own_writes-docstring\t0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e:tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py#tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py::test_run_repair_does_not_hold_a_lock_that_blocks_its_own_writes-docstring\tfa5a6e333dec79d185469e6df52f502f906fb50a:tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py#tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py::test_run_repair_does_not_hold_a_lock_that_blocks_its_own_writes-docstring\tDo not hold the non-reentrant tracker lock across repair's own writes. Each event write takes the lock. An outer hold would make the repair time out without progress and block other writers.\tPASS\t96\t32\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\r\ntests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py::test_unrepairable_finding_leaves_its_edge_and_the_run_continues-docstring\t0033662b5534531d84e39d4a14bf75c8e768e85e:tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py#tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py::test_unrepairable_finding_leaves_its_edge_and_the_run_continues-docstring\tfa5a6e333dec79d185469e6df52f502f906fb50a:tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py#tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor.py::test_unrepairable_finding_leaves_its_edge_and_the_run_continues-docstring\tLeave an unrepairable edge intact and continue other repairs. A closed resolved source cannot be relinked. The same run must repair unrelated findings and still return a status reporting outstanding work.\tPASS\t95\t31\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/resume_group04:2026-10-23\r\nt